br>Thistledown is mechanically light, but I've worked to make the gameplay as satisfying as possible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055960/extras/1d4440fd9b7dcd78917075c3f290ce27.avif?t=1635436563\" width=594 height=486 /></span><br>Oni carries an oversized thistle with her. You can make your way a little safer by killing things with it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jump</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055960/extras/d8ee449e5f0dca4559edaa8580e68748.avif?t=1635436563\" width=716 height=654 /></span><br>Oni is a Kouneli, a rabbit person. If nothing else works, she can always jump her way to safety.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055960/extras/dcae04a35866fa044a3ce09db29962e6.avif?t=1635436563\" width=674 height=618 /></span><br>What's going on? Explore the edges of this world. Figure out the backstory. Nothing's given to you, this game expects you to figure it out.<br>Best of luck.","developers":["Hermit Gamesmiths"],"dlc":[1329020],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055960/header.jpg?t=1635436563","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mavericks (OSX 10.9) OS or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1055960/286178/cd846c7f7edfffc4b6d0272e71035dc38baed7b2/1751182227/dash_av1.mpd?t=1589638862","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.